      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just finished my longest training run yet like 22 miles and my legs are absolutely killing me. i can barely walk. i need to take something strong tonight so i can actually sleep and not be crippled tomorrow. what's the most i can safely take of tylenol in a day so it actually works for this kind of pain?",
