      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not exceed the recommended maximum dosage, even if you feel you need more for a single night. Taking 5 or 6 grams is a dangerous overdose that can seriously affect your liver, regardless of how healthy you think you are. For this level of intense muscle pain, you should look into alternating with an NSAID like ibuprofen, or consider a prescription-strength option if the pain is truly debilitating.",
