      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get not going to 6g. but if 4000mg is the limit, and i've only had like 1500mg so far today... can i just take a bunch more right now to get ahead of the pain before i pass out? i feel like if i wait until the pain gets worse it'll be harder to manage. and if i mix the tylenol with some ibuprofen, does that mean i can take more of each since they work differently? i just need to know the absolute upper limit so i can sleep.",
